            <profile name="Purity of Execution" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">You can: During the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit within 18" of the unit visible to this model:
    -&gt; That unit is detected.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is detected, add 3 to that unit's detection range characteristic.</characteristic>
